color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida 10 km<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Carrera Pirata 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 Out<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Meia Maratona de Bilbau 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 19\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Bilbao Night Running Fest realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, 16 de outubro de 2027, em Bilbau, Espanha.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se situa o percurso da prova em Bilbau?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A corrida noturna decorre no centro urbano de Bilbau, percorrendo as margens da ria entre a zona do Est\u00e1dio San Mam\u00e9s e o Museu Guggenheim Bilbao.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias habituais do Bilbao Night Running Fest?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra a Maratona Noturna (42.195 km), a Meia Maratona oficial (21.097 km) e a Carrera Pirata de 10 km em circuito urbano.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a Meia Maratona de Bilbau?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do Club de Atletismo Bilbao Bilborun em conjunto com a Streetmarketing Event Company.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento e fazer a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A abertura das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e a publica\u00e7\u00e3o do regulamento oficial e hor\u00e1rios de 2027 decorrem no portal oficial do evento em www.bilbaonightrun.com.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Bilbau 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-10-16\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Bilbau, Espanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Bilbau\", \"addressRegion\": \"Europa\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Club de Atletismo Bilbao Bilborun \/ Streetmarketing Event Company\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Meia Maratona de Bilbau 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 19\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Bilbao Night Running Fest realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, 16 de outubro de 2027, em Bilbau, Espanha.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se situa o percurso da prova em Bilbau?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A corrida noturna decorre no centro urbano de Bilbau, percorrendo as margens da ria entre a zona do Est\u00e1dio San Mam\u00e9s e o Museu Guggenheim Bilbao.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias habituais do Bilbao Night Running Fest?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra a Maratona Noturna (42.195 km), a Meia Maratona oficial (21.097 km) e a Carrera Pirata de 10 km em circuito urbano.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a Meia Maratona de Bilbau?\", \"accep